#. ja: そうじゃない！<br>「3体すべて」に当たるように「<sheet Action 7381 0>」を使うんだ！
#. de: So nicht! Du musst alle drei Gegner in den Wir<shy>kungs<shy>be<shy>reich von <sheet Action 7381 0> bekommen!
#. fr: Tu dois faire en sorte que les trois mannequins soient touchés par <sheet Action 7381 0><nbsp>! N'utilise rien d'autre<nbsp>!
#. macro: <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
